Subject: dcast/spread with 2 columns that store values?
Message-ID: <vmk7xcicEeM.0Etz13NGFHIJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/manipulatr/c/vmk7xcicEeM/m/0Etz13NGFHIJ>
